<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Lowest Weights in Cohomology of Variations of Hodge Structure<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote">MSC2000 classification: 14C30, 32S35</span></span></span></h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Chris PETERS
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
